  "body": "## Problem\n\n`crates/kernel/tests/step_agreement.rs` has 498 lines after PR #2797. AGENTS.md (\"400-line files\") permits about 400 lines.\n\n## Work\n\n- Split the file along its domain seam (the bench table and its helpers, the row tests).\n- Keep each `#[test]`. The `#[test]` count before and after is the same.\n- Keep the Gate map header in each new file.\n\n## Source\n\nThe review of PR #2797 found this (comment 7020280963). The file was 477 lines before that PR.\n\nRefs #917\n",
